cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use propSAPT in your work, please cite the paper in preferred-citation.
  If you use the second-order properties, please also cite the preprint in
  references.
type: software
title: propSAPT
abstract: >-
  Python package for first-order interaction-induced properties and density
  matrices of molecular dimers in the spirit of symmetry-adapted perturbation
  theory (SAPT), built on Psi4.
